an><span begin="02:10.850" end="02:10.940">I </span><span begin="02:10.940" end="02:11.270">sold </span><span begin="02:11.270" end="02:11.510">my </span><span begin="02:11.510" end="02:12.380">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.410" end="02:14.390"><span begin="02:12.410" end="02:12.650">But </span><span begin="02:12.650" end="02:12.800">he </span><span begin="02:12.800" end="02:13.100">kept </span><span begin="02:13.100" end="02:13.220">the </span><span begin="02:13.220" end="02:14.390">receipt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.540" end="02:29.930"><span begin="02:26.540" end="02:26.960">So </span><span begin="02:26.960" end="02:27.200">leave </span><span begin="02:27.200" end="02:27.320">the </span><span begin="02:27.320" end="02:27.980">lights </span><span begin="02:27.980" end="02:28.160">on </span><span begin="02:28.160" end="02:28.520">I'm </span><span begin="02:28.520" end="02:29.000">coming </span><span begin="02:29.000" end="02:29.930">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.960" end="02:33.170"><span begin="02:29.960" end="02:30.230">It's </span><span begin="02:30.230" end="02:30.590">getting </span><span begin="02:30.590" end="02:31.190">darker </span><span begin="02:31.190" end="02:31.430">but </span><span begin="02:31.430" end="02:31.670">I'll </span><span begin="02:31.670" end="02:32.360">carry </span><span begin="02:32.360" end="02:33.170">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.200" end="02:36.440"><span begin="02:33.200" end="02:33.410">The </span><span begin="02:33.410" end="02:33.740">sun </span><span begin="02:33.740" end="02:33.860">won't </span><span begin="02:33.860" end="02:34.220">shine </span><span begin="02:34.220" end="02:34.820">but</span><span begin="02:34.820" end="02:34.850">, </span><span begin="02:34.850" end="02:35.090">it </span><span begin="02:35.090" end="02:35.480">never </span><span begin="02:35.480" end="02:36.440">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.470" end="02:37.700"><span begin="02:3